paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {\left\lbrack f(a) \right\rbrack^{2} = \left\lbrack 3a^{2} - a + 2 \right\rbrack^{2} = (3a^{2} - a + 2)(3a^{2} - a + 2)} \\
  {\phantom{\left\lbrack f(a) \right\rbrack^{2}} = 9a^{4} - 3a^{3} + 6a^{2} - 3a^{3} + a^{2} - 2a + 6a^{2} - 2a + 4 = 9a^{4} - 6a^{3} + 13a^{2} - 4a + 4\text{.}}
  \end{array}$$

item.paragraph:
            so $$f(x) = x + |x| = \begin{cases}
{2x} & {{if}x \geq 0} \\
0 & {{if}x < 0}
\end{cases}$$

            We could rewrite $$f$$ as $$f(x) = \begin{cases}
1 & {{if}x < - 1} \\
{- x} & {{if} - 1 \leq x < 0} \\
x & {{if}0 \leq x \leq 1} \\
1 & {{if}x > 1}
\end{cases}$$ .
